        "Hormonal balance (testosterone, thyroid modulation)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "mechanism",
      "text": "Withanolides modulate the hypothalamic–pituitary–adrenal (HPA) axis, reducing cortisol and stress responses. Ashwagandha may also enhance GABAergic signaling, contributing to anxiolytic and sleep-promoting effects. It has antioxidant and neuroprotective properties and may support testosterone production in men."
    },
    {
